  "resolved_major": [
    "Chimney denominator now exactly heights.len()-2, then layer as f32 / last_layer_index. This matches original14200bf6b..bf9d unsigned(length-2) conversion and14200c0e8 division. It no longer leaves the last of two emitted layers at t=0.5.",
    "Only production arithmetic change from frozenV1 is that denominator. Door candidate is byte-identical to the separately passed source. V1 original artifacts and redreview remain immutable."
  ],
  "test_scope": [
    "New actual emit helper regression sets three height splits, base_size0.5,size_delta0.3 and checks all four first-layer and all four final-layer Brick affine x-column lengths0.5/0.8. Old len-1 fails this nonzero-delta oracle; earlier delta0 checks could not detect the defect.",
    "Total five unit checks (two existing parameterEq plus three payload/RNG checks) remain unexecuted here. The callbacks observe real private emitter payloads, not actual SparseBuffer capacity, full ECS host, GPU or original native execution."
  ],
